":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":118,"digest":"sha256:28a9d9ec229067b43fcf8758565ca87f7405179e6af100746562f2a28f28fea7","download_count":4,"created_at":"2026-09-25T04:06:54Z","updated_at":"2026-09-25T04:06:54Z"},{"id":587487175,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4jBFfH","name":"DBX_0.6.23_x64.dmg","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":39379796,"digest":"sha256:9d40c0f55d33664741d869a193886309babde894d598f8178b4af599cc0b9f2b","download_count":6,"created_at":"2026-09-25T04:10:51Z","updated_at":"2026-09-25T04:10:53Z"},{"id":587446446,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4jA7iu","name":"DBX_0.6.23_x64_en-US.msi","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":34611200,"digest":"sha256:35af951ee513d6da45024354ee4bb7635d2565ee0afb9f8323ad20bcbd7b902d","download_count":7,"created_at":"2026-09-25T03:42:09Z","updated_at":"2026-09-25T03:42:15Z"},{"id":587487222,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4jBFf2","name":"DBX_x64.app.tar.gz","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":39300360,"digest":"sha256:e07af7a7f23bfb95196da92487fa57c7765462423496659af2f99d05e4ae1d95","download_count":9,"created_at":"2026-09-25T04:10:53Z","updated_at":"2026-09-25T04:10:55Z"},{"id":587502294,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4jBJLW","name":"latest.json","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":18867,"digest":"sha256:010089b3ff48fd4a5f2794bb75d6bba3267383facffa941377113ece9fdf13d8","download_count":976,"created_at":"2026-09-25T04:20:13Z","updated_at":"2026-09-25T04:20:13Z"}],"body":"### 新功能\n- 新增 Salesforce（SOQL）数据源，支持 OAuth 登录、SOQL 查询与分页、对象元数据浏览、网格编辑及 MCP 工具 (contributed by @zouchao) (PR [#10214](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10214))\n- PostgreSQL 系列连接支持浏览数据库级事件触发器（Event Trigger）对象 (contributed by @Tara8573) (PR [#10138](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10138))\n- 新增「导出数据字典」功能，可生成包含字段、注释与外键的 PDF 报告，支持选择模板、封面、目录与纸张方向 (contributed by @onenewcode) (PR [#10206](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10206))\n- 插件平台新增 AI 工具调用能力，插件可在用户逐次授权后访问连接数据\n- 插件沙箱新增系统剪贴板读取桥接，受 host.clipboard:read 权限门控，SSH 终端等插件可直接粘贴 (contributed by @jinpy666) (PR [#10155](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10155))\n- 插件快捷入口支持配置显示与停靠位置 (contributed by @Ezreal-byte) (PR [#10229](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10229))\n- 插件市场支持多种排序方式（名称、最近更新、最新发布等）并显示版本发布日期 (contributed by @Abeautifulsnow) (PR [#10247](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10247))\n- 可通过右键菜单直接打开插件提供的 Workbench (contributed by @0verme) (PR [#10244](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10244))\n- SQL 编辑器自动高亮整个文件中数据库不存在的表名与字段名，无需执行即可发现拼错或失效的名字 (contributed by @dafeng-001) (PR [#9771](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9771))\n- 双击例程可直接在源码页签打开查看定义 (contributed by @OOMEcho) (PR [#10237](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10237))\n- 查询结果页签支持点击固定与重命名，执行批次标签显示来源表名，并可配置页签名称是否包含数据库名 (contributed by @HighBigSky) (PR [#10173](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10173))\n- 查询结果显示请求等待时间与分阶段耗时明细，覆盖 SQL、MongoDB、Redis、Elasticsearch 及 JDBC 内部阶段 (contributed by @efeire) (PR [#10231](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10231))\n- 网格数据加载与刷新浮层新增停止按钮，可中断耗时操作 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10250](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10250))\n- 新增设置项控制网格列头提示（tooltip）的显示 (contributed by @OOMEcho) (PR [#10207](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10207))\n- 更新中心新增回退到旧版本的入口，折叠列出历史版本并跳转对应下载页，附数据备份风险提示 (contributed by @HighBigSky) (PR [#10220](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10220))\n### 改进\n- 查询耗时按自适应单位（毫秒/秒/分钟）显示，不再只显示原始毫秒数 (contributed by @Abeautifulsnow) (PR [#10223](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10223))\n- 插件 Dock 打开速度优化（HTML 缓存）并改进标签条最大化与折叠交互 (contributed by @jinpy666) (PR [#10253](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10253))\n- OceanBase 普通查询不再追加追踪 ID 与审计视图查询，减少额外开销 (contributed by @efeire) (PR [#10231](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10231))\n### 修复\n- MySQL 连接时可选 group_concat 设置被兼容引擎（KunDB、TDDL、Gaea 等）拒绝时自动回退重连，不再连接失败 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10204](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10204))\n- MySQL group_concat 回退后按服务端实际值补足下限，长结果不再被截断，也不会降低服务端已有配置 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10270](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10270))\n- MySQL 识别 TDSQL 截断 group_concat_max_len 的报错并触发回退 (contributed by @thanadon-dev) (PR [#10234](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10234))\n- MySQL 识别 TXSQL 5.7 截断变量名的 1193 拒绝并触发 group_concat 回退 (contributed by @jyking) (PR [#10222](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10222))\n- MySQL 导出 SQL 脚本声明 utf8mb4 字符集，避免中文等字符乱码 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10266](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10266))\n- MySQL 数据传输遇到仅含生成列的表时通过空列 INSERT 保留行数，不再传输失败 (contributed by @CN-Scars) (PR [#10264](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10264))\n- JDBC Oracle 表补全不再遗漏同义词 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10256](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10256))\n- JDBC Oracle 同义词正确加载字段类型与注释 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10259](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10259))\n- Oracle 用户自定义类型列以占位符展示，不再报错 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10260](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10260))\n- 结构比较修正 Oracle/JDBC 连接的列、索引与视图差异 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10265](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10265))\n- Doris 查看物化视图 DDL 报错或为空时回退 SHOW CREATE MATERIALIZED VIEW (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10272](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10272))\n- OceanBase Oracle 模式表补全支持跨 schema 检索并对齐大小写模糊匹配 (contributed by @Mo-Moore) (PR [#10168](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10168))\n- 达梦空 schema 场景按会话当前 schema 解析，恢复表清单、列注释与 DDL 查看 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10271](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10271))\n- Redis 分组删除改为按前缀删除整个键子树 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10268](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10268))\n- SSH 远程 SQLite 并行打开时不再损坏上传的 worker 文件 (contributed by @64673a) (PR [#10166](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10166))\n- SSH 远程 SQLite 批量保存改为事务执行，不再报操作不可用错误 (contributed by @64673a) (PR [#10179](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10179))\n- MongoDB 非字符串列正确应用 substring 过滤条件 (contributed by @thailoc-dev) (PR [#10160](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10160))\n- SQL Server 表提示不再被误判为语句起点，修复语句边界识别错误 (contributed by @dienaso) (PR [#10236](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10236))\n- 例程与触发器的「查看 DDL」返回对象自身定义，不再显示生成的 CREATE TABLE (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10274](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10274))\n- SQL 编辑器在 SELECT 列表或 UPDATE SET 后的光标位置自动触发字段补全 (contributed by @ma123456mai) (PR [#10262](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10262))\n- 保留大小写的引擎（Oracle 等）上单列查询结果保持可编辑 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10267](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10267))\n- 网格复制为 SQL 时 JSON 中的大整数保持精确值，不再被舍入 (contributed by @thanadon-dev) (PR [#10141](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10141))\n- 网格原始行号模式下未保存新增行显示占位行号，不再与已有行重号 (contributed by @xianghu908) (PR [#10208](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10208))\n- 插件 Dock 加号选择器保持在窗口内并向下展开 (contributed by @jinpy666) (PR [#10261](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10261))\n- 插件快捷入口停靠右侧时拖动预览位置正确镜像 (contributed by @Ezreal-byte) (PR [#10273](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10273))\n- Windows 更新时先清空缓存 ready 目录再重命名，修复更新安装失败 (contributed by @mr-dadong) (PR [#10161](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10161))\n- 工具栏检查更新同时检测 MCP 更新 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10226](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10226))\n- 页签提示可立即关闭并优化显示样式 (contributed by @aiLi0617) (PR [#10228](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10228))\n- 降低启动初始加载耗时并解除应用恢复阻塞\n- AI 助手在默认动作选择前先初始化会话连接绑定，修复绑定未生效的问题\n- Linux 系统凭据服务访问移至独立线程，避免在异步运行时中访问导致失败或卡顿\n### 安装\n- 新增 Win7 静态浏览器版发布包，dbx-web 支持将静态资源内嵌到二进制，更新时可直接替换文件 (contributed by @zhwq1216) (PR [#9580](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/9580))\n\n---\n<!-- dbx-cnb-mirror -->\n> 国内下载：如果 GitHub 下载较慢，可从 [CNB 镜像](https://cnb.cool/dbxio.com/dbx/-/releases/tag/v0.6.23) 下载桌面端安装包，Docker 镜像从 `docker.cnb.cool/dbxio.com/dbx:v0.6.23` 拉取。\n","reactions":{"total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":24}
